# IMPORTANT: dockerignore patterns are matched against the FULL relative path
# (filepath.Match semantics, NOT gitignore): a pattern without a slash would
# only match the context root. The `**/` prefix is required to exclude nested
# paths (backend/.env, frontend/node_modules, backend/data, __pycache__, ...).
**/.git
**/node_modules
**/data
**/piano
**/music
**/e2e
**/.env
**/.venv
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.coverage
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.DS_Store
